  "description": "After playing the worst match of his life, pro footballer Minhyuk ’s life comes to a tragic end in a car accident… Or so everyone thinks. He wakes up, alive and swell, in the body of Baek Chan—the heir to Baek Pharmaceuticals. Despite his best efforts to move on and live as Chan, the memories of his past life keep haunting Minhyuk and he ends up at his now-widowed wife’s door… Will Minhyuk tell Sooyeon who he is? And more importantly, will this new lease on life lead to an old lease on love?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: The chapter count includes a prologue*",
